    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff9f9d2408e6393e88951c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标是足以被称为本世代巅峰的成绩，\n还是登上世界舞台的跳板呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cda1b020240458c1a0bb6d228b5de8d61797dbf01f3370db585eecdbeaa56b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
