    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af0b27f7b44e27dd4b7c286",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但东瀛佐敦现在的想法只有一个，\n那就是“想赢过阿船”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e96b4dcebafbcae56a0691f277c3aced89000538ce0481062cb370e9f63313e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048415.json",
      "json_path": [
