    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ab5e8a8d559634b350f622",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于单纯又心无旁骛的东瀛佐敦，\n中山庆典惊讶、傻眼、露出笑容……\n并燃起了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b89e80a54b880321b62a3f38d60045ddd520ee9bdda2666fa6912987880ba68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048415.json",
