      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ccac97bb7cb558e626a73ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们望着赛道，对集结于\n“天皇赏（秋）”的豪华阵容寄予期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "411b641bf4abb16be78913d89f2bd5092b83dd4b972b9328412313492d418321",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51dda284b779601e9b7f1bc7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦的朋友们望着赛道，\n祈祷她的努力能开花结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07ff9c5c109c6b2afa4a38186c58689e93defd0d6bee93fb8ae89380f5bc7ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89796c4529cf47dc8ea950b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而东瀛佐敦告诉训练员她的抱负。\n她要跑出\n将潮流与历史全部改写的精彩表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb56a533f0745a0a586610a57f542acc26836914cd0e58c746c57433e8e2ccb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5bd74c11bd4e726ac053aa8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "靠着至今锻炼出的身体。\n驱使至今自己全力学到的一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb70e44dbea0d222373d6060fed345c575f6e115e588520e8bae4363b373b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99ee2e5d31ecac3ee120121",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我要去做最强傻事了，\n把期望放在我身上直到最后一刻吧。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5dc1070d9e20fcbcd332d923ee90f381fc9306b0cf50833fb26a498733d8b11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
