      "uid": "zhcn:62e46b0327bac3fd3ea22eef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此，必须先展现自己的实力！\n在训练员的推荐下，\n她开始以新马级GⅠ“希望S”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e1a08d6b79d0550e714d7a5e3282abc963a72b2daa3c67f38fa3e0f8ff1d92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
